OL,5,G1500 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FA hot pursuit gets even hotter
OL,7,     Fwhen the pursuing car's brakes
OL,8,     Fcatch fire. A gadget allows
OL,9,     Fthieves to clone keyfob signals
OL,10,     Fremotely and steal cars without
OL,11,     Fthe keys.
OL,12,G1600 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FOn patrol across Derbyshire, the
OL,14,     Fofficers tackle a huge variety of
OL,15,     Fcrimes, ranging from drunk or
OL,16,     Fdrugged driving to catching gangs
OL,17,     Fstealing cars or running drugs
OL,18,     Facross county lines.
