OL,5,G1700 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThe team joins forces with the
OL,7,     Fchopper to track down a wanted
OL,8,     Fcriminal on a motorbike, and a
OL,9,     Fyoung driver crashes straight into
OL,10,     Fan unmarked police car.
OL,11,G1800 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FA torrential downpour hampers
OL,13,     Fpolice at a major crash scene on
OL,14,     Fthe M1, and PC Ange Salous
OL,15,     Fconfronts a not-so-happy chappy.
OL,16,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,17,     FAn armed drink-driver leads the
OL,18,     Finterceptors through a graveyard.
OL,19,     FA man is given a lesson in road
OL,20,     Fsafety after attempting to use a
OL,21,     Fmoped as a minibus.
