OL,5,G2000 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FAnge stands up to a couple of
OL,7,     Fheavyweights and Craig is
OL,8,     Funimpressed by one man's feeble
OL,9,     Fattempt to disguise his identity.
OL,10,G2100 Trauma Room One
OL,11,     FJames, 63, is losing feeling and
OL,12,     Ffunction in his hands and fingers.
OL,13,     FSurgeons must act fast to remove
OL,14,     Fdisc and bone from his neck. Will
OL,15,     Fthey save James from an uncertain
OL,16,     Ffuture? (Ep8)
