OL,5,G2200 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,6,G     Death
OL,7,     FWith Syed's life hanging in the
OL,8,     Fbalance as his testicular cancer
OL,9,     Fspreads into his heart, consultant
OL,10,     Furological surgeons must undertake
OL,11,     Fa radical plan to remove the
OL,12,     Ftumour.
OL,13,G2300 A&E After Dark
OL,14,     FA patient is flown in by air
OL,15,     Fambulance after falling down a
OL,16,     Fditch with her mobility scooter; a
OL,17,     Fwoman is treated after impaling
OL,18,     Fher eye on a tent peg and an ankle
OL,19,     Fneeds treatment.
