OL,5,G0155 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Adil Sheraz helps a patient
OL,7,     Fwho's been quoted #4500 elsewhere
OL,8,     Fto remove his five head cysts. Dr
OL,9,     FEmma McMullen turns detective to
OL,10,     Fget to the bottom of a mystery
OL,11,     Fskin condition.
OL,12,G0245 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FAt Bradford's Ridge Medical
OL,14,     FPractice, baby Imaan is suffering
OL,15,     Fsevere nappy rash, Aris has been
OL,16,     Fleaking yellow fluid from a cyst
OL,17,     Fin his armpit, and Gemma has a
OL,18,     Fworrying tongue ulcer.
